@baseUrl = http://localhost:8085
@adminToken = REPLACE_WITH_ADMIN_OR_SUPER_ADMIN_JWT

### Public location discovery
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/locations?q=Hà Nội

### Admin list
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/locations
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Create location
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/locations
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bến xe Mỹ Đình",
  "province": "Hà Nội",
  "address": "20 Phạm Hùng, Mỹ Đình 2, Nam Từ Liêm"
}

### Replace location
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/locations/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bến xe Mỹ Đình",
  "province": "Hà Nội",
  "address": "20 Phạm Hùng, Mỹ Đình 2, Nam Từ Liêm"
}
